	JMP AINCOR	/IS IN CORE
	CDF 0		/IS NOT
	CIF 10
	JMS I SYSTEM	/SO LOAD IT
	10
AINCOR,	CDF 10
	CLA CMA
	DCA I [7700
	CDF 0
	TAD [200
	DCA SYSTEM
